unty"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 75 years, 1951 to 2025. On the middle of the county&rsquo;s grids, October to November came in under 90% of normal in 37 of those years. Late 2025 ran short on the middle of the grids, with October to November at 60% and November to December at 30% in 2025. So far in 2026, February to March sits at 54% of normal on the middle of the grids.</p>"}
